                'content_en' => '<p>OpenGovPortal now offers AI-assisted actions directly inside the rich text editor. Editors can select text and run Fix Grammar, Summarise, Expand or Translate without copying content to an external tool.</p><p>Administrators choose the AI provider and model on the AI Settings page. API keys are stored encrypted and every call is logged without storing the text itself, in line with the AI Use in Content Policy.</p><p>The feature is off by default and can be switched on by a super admin once a provider has been configured.</p>',
