                'content_en' => '<p>Whenever content is published, the portal copies its title and text into a single index table with separate columns for Bahasa Malaysia and English. PostgreSQL builds a full-text index on each column, so search runs inside the same database without an extra service.</p><p>Results are ranked by content type priority and match score. Administrators can also add promoted links for specific keywords, for example showing the Contact Us page at the top when a visitor searches for "contact".</p><p>This approach keeps costs low and makes installation straightforward for small agencies.</p>',
