                'content_en' => '<p>Good bilingual content is not a word-for-word translation. Five tips from the editorial team:</p><ol><li>Write the full Bahasa Malaysia version first, then rewrite it in English with the same meaning.</li><li>Keep sentences under 25 words. Short sentences are easier to translate and to read.</li><li>Use the portal glossary so feature names stay consistent in both languages.</li><li>Avoid abbreviations without an explanation on first use.</li><li>Read both versions aloud before publishing.</li></ol>',
